{"id":208,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><style>@font-face{ font-family:\"Times New Roman\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"宋体\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Wingdings\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Arial\";} p.MsoNormal{ mso-style-name:正文; mso-style-parent:\"\"; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-family:'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; font-size:12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} h1{ mso-style-name:\"标题 1\"; mso-style-next:正文; margin-top:5.0000pt; margin-bottom:5.0000pt; mso-margin-top-alt:auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto; mso-pagination:none; text-align:left; font-family:宋体; font-weight:bold; font-size:24.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;} h2{ mso-style-name:\"标题 2\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-next:正文; margin-top:13.0000pt; margin-bottom:13.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top:0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom:0.0000gd; page-break-after:avoid; mso-pagination:lines-together; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level:2; line-height:172%; font-family:Arial; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-font-weight:bold; font-size:14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} span.10{ font-family:'Times New Roman';} span.msoIns{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:underline; text-underline:single; color:blue;} span.msoDel{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:line-through; color:red;} table.MsoNormalTable{ mso-style-name:普通表格; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-para-margin:0pt; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.0000pt; mso-ansi-language:#0400; mso-fareast-language:#0400; mso-bidi-language:#0400;} @page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no; mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{ margin-top:72.0000pt; margin-bottom:72.0000pt; margin-left:90.0000pt; margin-right:90.0000pt; size:595.3000pt 841.9000pt; vsb_temp:15.6000pt; mso-header-margin:42.5500pt; mso-footer-margin:49.6000pt;} div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style><div><p>为强化学生诚信应考意识，筑牢道德根基，营造风清气正的考风学风，12月9日下午18：30，材料科学与工程学院24030Z01班以“诚信应考，从我做起”为主题，召开诚信教育主题班会。本次班会由班主任李静老师主持，全班同学共同参与，通过多元形式的活动，让诚信理念深植每一位同学心中。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wL4vXYUmUDMmUbM/lUsU4CsnmUanllKZU4QfnR62M8rknml0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyin1y8oSyaUzC4nlLioRnRnzGbMz-bM4TfUlQ7Mz9PnRWFMmU8L4-PnRWFLzAVozvJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLR9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17008&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/55F490A63EC584CE0952979AAFD581D2/644321D2/18E97\" vheight=\"415\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wL4vXYUmUDMmUbM/lUsU4CsnmUanllKZU4QfnR62M8rknml0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyin1y8oSyaUzC4nlLioRnRnzGbMz-bM4TfUlQ7Mz9PnRWFMmU8L4-PnRWFLzAVozvJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLR9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17008&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>班会伊始，李静老师开门见山，阐述了诚信在个人成长、人际交往及社会发展中的重要意义。她结合校园生活实际，指出了考试作弊、作业抄袭、言行不一等失信行为的危害，强调诚信是立身之本、成事之基，鼓励同学们将诚信内化于心、外化于行。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wU8nX7ozVVnm9Yo/zN4M8-sLmf2M7UKYoRARMmUsUmUZMzl0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yiUSy4LYyaLmNaolV2nzfkU4QRUz-sM7QfL7-sMN7YnRTFnNlaolnknRQFLzCbMRLJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLR9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17008&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/65A3302909AFE0BC6CA274FA0B76A2D9/FE09DBD6/16943\" vheight=\"415\" vwidth=\"554\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wU8nX7ozVVnm9Yo/zN4M8-sLmf2M7UKYoRARMmUsUmUZMzl0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yiUSy4LYyaLmNaolV2nzfkU4QRUz-sM7QfL7-sMN7YnRTFnNlaolnknRQFLzCbMRLJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLR9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17008&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>为进一步强化诚信意识，班会尾声还举行了“诚信宣誓”仪式。在班长的带领下，全班同学举起右拳，庄严宣誓：“遵守校纪校规，恪守诚信准则；勤奋学习，杜绝舞弊；真诚待人，信守承诺；以诚信立身，以笃行致远”铿锵有力的誓言回荡在教室中，不仅是同学们对诚信的郑重承诺，更是对美好品德的坚定追求。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wMmfXkMlV7ozGbL/RL8MNnRM8Csnz6KkLmffUlL4M478oRv0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h7LkyZM1yPMR9iL7CYnRNZnl-aLRCPL8UZLm9DMNCDU8VFMmGinmQVU8nFL4rRU4CJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLR9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17008&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2D08614850F2D98EB00613D82866F6CA/605F6ECD/35CC6\" vheight=\"415\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wMmfXkMlV7ozGbL/RL8MNnRM8Csnz6KkLmffUlL4M478oRv0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h7LkyZM1yPMR9iL7CYnRNZnl-aLRCPL8UZLm9DMNCDU8VFMmGinmQVU8nFL4rRU4CJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLR9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17008&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wL7nX7UzfVL8nfL/7LZnzNPMNC4LN7KsLRf2U8CYnlrfL4L0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky8oSyDMShVU4LPM4LsU49PoRn2M4ARo7VfolQfUz7bLzrFnRLiL7W2UmrFL8nkU4CJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLR9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17008&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/04965EC31737C8184F78C8AA9FAA1915/D350BFB5/3DBC6\" vheight=\"415\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wL7nX7UzfVL8nfL/7LZnzNPMNC4LN7KsLRf2U8CYnlrfL4L0gihFp2hmCIa0Lky8oSyDMShVU4LPM4LsU49PoRn2M4ARo7VfolQfUz7bLzrFnRLiL7W2UmrFL8nkU4CJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLR9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17008&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>最后，李静老师对本次班会进行总结，她希望同学们以此次班会为契机，在学习和生活中始终坚守诚信底线，树立良好学风班风，互相监督、互相提醒，共同营造公平公正、诚信有序的考试环境，以真实成绩展现学习成效，以诚信品格践行成长担当，切实将诚信意识融入日常学习生活，争做诚信自律的合格学生。</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://3y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=wL4vXYUmUDMmUbM/lUsU4CsnmUanllKZU4QfnR62M8rknml0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyin1y8oSyaUzC4nlLioRnRnzGbMz-bM4TfUlQ7Mz9PnRWFMmU8L4-PnRWFLzAVozvJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzvaLR9JqdOnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=17008&e=.png"}